WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.641
The take-home: CCS succeeds because of the
displacement information in its contrast-pair data,

00:00:06.721 --> 00:00:08.786
not its specific loss formula.

00:00:08.866 --> 00:00:14.077
A simple Midpoint-Displacement loss reproduces CCS
and, retuned, beats it.

00:00:14.157 --> 00:00:16.508
The exact loss is interchangeable;

00:00:16.588 --> 00:00:20.870
the real lever is the displacement-versus-midpoint
trade-off.
